    "RowOffset": 760078,
    "RowId": 40696,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 760090,
    "RowId": 40697,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 760102,
    "RowId": 40698,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 760114,
    "RowId": 40699,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 760126,
    "RowId": 40700,
    "Text": "A vicious blow! That'll leave a mark!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 760174,
    "RowId": 40701,
    "Text": "Even I felt that one! But the challenger's still standing!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 760246,
    "RowId": 40702,
    "Text": "Beautifully dodged!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 760278,
    "RowId": 40703,
    "Text": "Amazing! The challenger saw straight through it!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 760338,
    "RowId": 40704,
    "Text": "Oh my! The challenger went down hard!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 760386,
    "RowId": 40705,
    "Text": "And they're down! Is it over already!?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 760438,
    "RowId": 40706,
    "Text": "They're back on their feet! What grit!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 760490,
    "RowId": 40707,
    "Text": "They're still in it! But for how long!?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 760542,
    "RowId": 40708,
    "Text": "What power! Looks like someone isn't holding back!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 760606,
    "RowId": 40709,
    "Text": "Such potent magicks! But will they be enough to turn the tide?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 760682,
    "RowId": 40710,
    "Text": "They're bracing for the storm with an ironclad defense!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 760750,
    "RowId": 40711,
    "Text": "Oh dear! The challenger has fallen out of the ring!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 760814,
    "RowId": 40712,
    "Text": "It's all over...until next time!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 760858,
    "RowId": 40713,
    "Text": "That struck square!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 760890,
    "RowId": 40714,
    "Text": "Oof! Will the challenger be alright!?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 760938,
    "RowId": 40715,
    "Text": "Oh no, they couldn't avoid that one!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 760986,
    "RowId": 40716,
    "Text": "That must have hurt! But they're not out of the fight yet!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 761058,
    "RowId": 40717,
    "Text": "Effortlessly dodged!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 761090,
    "RowId": 40718,
    "Text": "Amazing! They clearly anticipated that attack!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 761150,
    "RowId": 40719,
    "Text": "A stylish evasion, well done!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 761190,
    "RowId": 40720,
    "Text": "Avoided with ease! They knew just what to do!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 761246,
    "RowId": 40721,
    "Text": "Oh no, that was too much for the challenger!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 761302,
    "RowId": 40722,
    "Text": "The challenger's down! Is this the end!?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 761354,
    "RowId": 40723,
    "Text": "The challenger rises again! Can they turn this around!?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 761422,
    "RowId": 40724,
    "Text": "They're back on their feet! Let's see if they can stay standing!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 761498,
    "RowId": 40725,
    "Text": "Oof, that must've hurt! Hang in there!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 761550,
    "RowId": 40726,
    "Text": "Not fast enough, I'm afraid!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 761590,
    "RowId": 40727,
    "Text": "Even I felt that! Can't afford to be careless, now!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 761654,
    "RowId": 40728,
    "Text": "A direct hit! But they're still standing!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 761706,
    "RowId": 40729,
    "Text": "Impressive footwork on display today!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 761754,
    "RowId": 40730,
    "Text": "And they dance out of the way unharmed! Unbelievable!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 761818,
    "RowId": 40731,
    "Text": "Another attack evaded with aplomb!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 761866,
    "RowId": 40732,
    "Text": "Once again they slip beyond their opponent's reach!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 761930,
    "RowId": 40733,
    "Text": "Oh no, they've been felled with a vengeance!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 761986,
    "RowId": 40734,
    "Text": "And they're down! Can they recover from this?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 762042,
    "RowId": 40735,
    "Text": "They're up! What fighting spirit!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 762086,
    "RowId": 40736,
    "Text": "And they're back in action! Can they turn the tide!?"
  },
